<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<rss version="2.0" xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/"><channel><title>救生艇新闻：博客——保护人类</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/</link><description></description><lastBuildDate>Wed, 19 Aug 2026 00:33:43 GMT</lastBuildDate><generator>rfeed v1.1.1</generator><docs>https://github.com/svpino/rfeed/blob/master/README.md</docs><item><title>研究人员发现星链的新用途，将 1,200 颗卫星变成大气传感器</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/researchers-found-a-new-use-for-starlink-turning-1200-satellites-into-atmospheric-sensors</link><description>众所周知，地球大气层中难以观测的部分可能有一双意想不到的新眼睛。研究人员正在利用巨大的轨道数据源，这对卫星跟踪和空间安全具有潜在的好处。 &lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/researchers-found-a-new-use-for-starlink-turning-1200-satellites-into-atmospheric-sensors.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Wed, 19 Aug 2026 00:33:39 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/researchers-found-a-new-use-for-starlink-turning-1200-satellites-into-atmospheric-sensors</guid></item><item><title>工业物联网交货时间达到 52 周，而所有人都认为短缺已经结束</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/industrial-iot-lead-times-hit-52-weeks-while-everyone-calls-the-shortage-over</link><description>尽管普遍认为芯片短缺已经结束，但到 2026 年，先进微控制器和传感器融合芯片的工业物联网交货时间将延长至 24-52 周。代工厂优先考虑高利润的人工智能芯片，而不是工业物联网传感器和网关所依赖的成熟节点部件，而仍在根据旧的交货时间假设进行预算的采购团队即将陷入困境。 &lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/industrial-iot-lead-times-hit-52-weeks-while-everyone-calls-the-shortage-over.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Wed, 19 Aug 2026 00:18:39 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/industrial-iot-lead-times-hit-52-weeks-while-everyone-calls-the-shortage-over</guid></item><item><title>我们认为是永久性的老化损伤</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/the-aging-damage-we-thought-was-permanent</link><description>&lt;img src="https://politepaul.com/fd/dtDF30237DhP.xml" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Wed, 19 Aug 2026 00:03:39 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/the-aging-damage-we-thought-was-permanent</guid></item><item><title>这位教授是他自己的衰老研究中唯一的受试者，最终将他的生物年龄降低了15岁</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/this-professor-was-the-only-subject-in-his-own-aging-study-and-ended-up-reducing-his-biological-age-by-15-years</link><description>该制度带来了一些显着的改进。 &lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/this-professor-was-the-only-subject-in-his-own-aging-study-and-ended-up-reducing-his-biological-age-by-15-years.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Tue, 18 Aug 2026 23:48:39 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/this-professor-was-the-only-subject-in-his-own-aging-study-and-ended-up-reducing-his-biological-age-by-15-years</guid></item><item><title>非重复光子晶体可以实现更可调、更可靠的半导体激光器</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/nonrepeating-photonic-crystal-may-enable-more-tunable-reliable-semiconductor-lasers</link><description>在过去的二十年中，光子晶体表面发射激光器（PCSEL）作为一种先进的半导体激光器，在国防和航空航天相关应用中显示出良好的前景。通常，这些设备由在设备区域重复的光子晶体图案制成。但电气和计算机工程教授 Kent Choquette 实验室的新研究展示了准周期光子晶体表面发射激光器 (QPCSEL)。该小组的设备采用埋置电介质平台制造，突出了创建可调谐、更可靠的半导体激光器的新途径。他们的发现发表在《应用物理快报》上。 &lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/nonrepeating-photonic-crystal-may-enable-more-tunable-reliable-semiconductor-lasers.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Tue, 18 Aug 2026 23:33:39 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/nonrepeating-photonic-crystal-may-enable-more-tunable-reliable-semiconductor-lasers</guid></item><item><title>今日天空 8 月 18 日星期二：星星和烟花</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/the-sky-today-on-tuesday-august-18-stars-and-sparklers</link><description>今晚晚些时候，无月的天空为深空观察者提供了绝佳的机会。尝试一下疏散星团 NGC 6939，它是著名的烟花星系的邻居。 &lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/the-sky-today-on-tuesday-august-18-stars-and-sparklers.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Tue, 18 Aug 2026 23:18:39 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/the-sky-today-on-tuesday-august-18-stars-and-sparklers</guid></item><item><title>阿尔茨海默病中的食欲素、睡眠和认知非快速眼动振荡活动和神经弹性</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/orexin-sleep-and-cognition-in-alzheimer-diseasenon-rem-oscillatory-activity-and-neural-resilience</link><description>该网站使用安全服务来防范恶意机器人。当网站验证您不是机器人时会显示此页面。 &lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/orexin-sleep-and-cognition-in-alzheimer-diseasenon-rem-oscillatory-activity-and-neural-resilience2.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Tue, 18 Aug 2026 23:03:39 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/orexin-sleep-and-cognition-in-alzheimer-diseasenon-rem-oscillatory-activity-and-neural-resilience</guid></item><item><title>纳武单抗的生物标志物对可切除非小细胞肺癌有益</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/biomarkers-of-nivolumab-benefit-in-resectable-nonsmall-cell-lung-cancer</link><description>从 CheckMate 77T 试验的可评估参与者中确定了非小细胞肺癌围手术期纳武单抗治疗获益的潜在预测生物标志物。 &lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/biomarkers-of-nivolumab-benefit-in-resectable-nonsmall-cell-lung-cancer.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Tue, 18 Aug 2026 22:48:39 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/biomarkers-of-nivolumab-benefit-in-resectable-nonsmall-cell-lung-cancer</guid></item><item><title>使用 RoadRunner、MATLAB 和 NVIDIA Cosmos 从高清地图到逼真的驾驶视频</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/from-hd-maps-to-photorealistic-driving-video-with-roadrunner-matlab-and-nvidia-cosmos</link><description>本文改编自 MathWorks Japan 的应用工程团队在 2026 年 7 月 15 日研讨会上发表的演讲“使用 RoadRunner/MATLAB 生成 Cosmos Transfer 的输入视频”。 &lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/from-hd-maps-to-photorealistic-driving-video-with-roadrunner-matlab-and-nvidia-cosmos2.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Tue, 18 Aug 2026 22:33:39 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/from-hd-maps-to-photorealistic-driving-video-with-roadrunner-matlab-and-nvidia-cosmos</guid></item><item><title>秋田希望成为日本最大的人工智能数据中心</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/akita-eyes-ai-data-center-that-could-become-japans-largest</link><description>目前正在计划在秋田县建立一个人工智能数据中心，该中心可能成为日本最大的数据中心。 &lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/akita-eyes-ai-data-center-that-could-become-japans-largest.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Tue, 18 Aug 2026 22:18:39 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/akita-eyes-ai-data-center-that-could-become-japans-largest</guid></item></channel></rss>